{"text": "She struck another match, and there was Grandmother, bright and kind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Grandmother, cried the little girl, Please take me with you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the match goes out, you will disappear like the warm stove. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Quickly she lit all the other matches to keep Grandmother there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The light was brighter than the sun at noon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Grandmother took her in her arms, and they flew up together to a place with no cold and no hunger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On New Years morning, people found the little girl in the corner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was very still, with a smile on her face and burnt matches in her hand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She wanted to warm herself, people said sadly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But no one knew the beautiful things she had seen. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was with her grandmother now, and she would never be cold again.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "r", "u", "c", "k", " ", "a", "n", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "m", "a", "t", "c", "h", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "G", "r", "a", "n", "d", "m", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", ",", " ", "b", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "k", "i", "n", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "G", "r", "a", "n", "d", "m", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", ",", " ", "c", "r", "i", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "g", "i", "r", "l", ",", " ", "P", "l", "e", "a", "s", "e", " ", "t", "a", "k", "e", " ", "m", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "y", "o", "u", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "t", "c", "h", " ", "g", "o", "e", "s", " ", "o", "u", "t", ",", " ", "